{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a1-explainer-about-popular-cakes-teach-how-a-cake-is-made-mix-flour-sugar-eggs-and-butter/audio/main-5ee399751811.mp3","durationSec":120.408,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":3.9,"text":"First, mix flour, sugar, eggs, and butter in a bowl."},{"start":4.7,"end":7.66,"text":"Baking powder can help the cake rise, or get bigger."},{"start":8.42,"end":11.04,"text":"Put the mixture in a cake pan and bake it in an oven."},{"start":11.68,"end":14.44,"text":"After baking, let the cake cool, so it is not hot."},{"start":15.18,"end":18.28,"text":"Then you can add cream, fruit, jam, or icing."},{"start":19.02,"end":21.3,"text":"People often eat cake at birthdays and weddings."},{"start":21.3,"end":25.56,"text":"Victoria sponge comes from Britain, or the United Kingdom."},{"start":26.16,"end":27.68,"text":"It was named after Queen Victoria."},{"start":28.22,"end":30.46,"text":"The cake has two soft sponge layers."},{"start":30.46,"end":33.14,"text":"Jam goes between them, like a sandwich."},{"start":34.26,"end":36.5,"text":"Many modern cakes also have cream inside."},{"start":37.2,"end":39.9,"text":"The top is usually simple, with a little powdered sugar."},{"start":40.58,"end":43.86,"text":"Baking powder helps this buttery cake rise and become light."},{"start":45.16,"end":47.32,"text":"Black Forest cake is a German layer cake."},{"start":47.92,"end":52.58,"text":"Its cake layers contain cocoa, so they are dark and taste of chocolate."},{"start":53.62,"end":55.98,"text":"Cherries and whipped cream go between the layers."},{"start":55.98,"end":59.76,"text":"More cream, cherries, and chocolate can decorate the top."},{"start":59.76,"end":65.1,"text":"A written recipe from 1927 is kept in Radolfzell, Germany."},{"start":65.1,"end":68.08,"text":"Today, people can find this cake in cafes around the world."},{"start":69.04,"end":75.74,"text":"In the United States, strawberry shortcake has strawberries and cream with a biscuit-like shortcake or sponge cake."},{"start":76.38,"end":77.62,"text":"It is often a summer dessert."},{"start":78.28,"end":83.26,"text":"In Japan, the cake usually has light sponge layers, whipped cream, and fresh strawberries."},{"start":83.26,"end":86.98,"text":"Fujiya introduced this style there in 1922."},{"start":87.84,"end":90.2,"text":"It later became a popular Christmas cake."},{"start":91.1,"end":96.18,"text":"The two styles share strawberries and cream, but their cake bases can be different."},{"start":97.54,"end":101.38,"text":"Tres leches is a Latin American cake that is very popular in Mexico."},{"start":102.44,"end":104.44,"text":"Its name means “three milks.”"},{"start":105.32,"end":110.58,"text":"Bakers soak a light sponge cake in evaporated milk, condensed milk, and whole milk."},{"start":110.58,"end":116.3,"text":"Small air bubbles in the sponge hold the milk, so the cake stays soft without becoming a wet mess."},{"start":117.02,"end":119.86,"text":"Whipped cream often goes on top, with fruit or cinnamon."}],"words":[{"text":"First","start":0,"end":0.36},{"text":"mix","start":0.86,"end":1},{"text":"flour","start":1,"end":1.4},{"text":"sugar","start":1.78,"end":1.96},{"text":"eggs","start":2.36,"end":2.6},{"text":"and","start":2.84,"end":2.96},{"text":"butter","start":2.96,"end":3.22},{"text":"in","start":3.22,"end":3.48},{"text":"a","start":3.48,"end":3.62},{"text":"bowl","start":3.62,"end":3.9},{"text":"Baking","start":4.7,"end":4.94},{"text":"powder","start":4.94,"end":5.22},{"text":"can","start":5.22,"end":5.52},{"text":"help","start":5.52,"end":5.78},{"text":"the","start":5.78,"end":5.98},{"text":"cake","start":5.98,"end":6.18},{"text":"rise","start":6.18,"end":6.6},{"text":"or","start":6.6,"end":7.1},{"text":"get","start":7.1,"end":7.3},{"text":"bigger","start":7.3,"end":7.66},{"text":"Put","start":8.42,"end":8.52},{"text":"the","start":8.52,"end":8.68},{"text":"mixture","start":8.68,"end":8.9},{"text":"in","start":8.9,"end":9.1},{"t